  gate_id: test-coverage
  negative_control: "Reverting either walker to the key-only exemption (compactStrings in read-output-budget.ts or compactContextIntentValue in context-intent-contracts.ts) fails the three GH-1754 specs in tests/unit/sdk/read-output/continuation-tokens.spec.ts; forcing the list surface for every read fails the extension-rows spec, so genuine tokens in an extension's items rows stay protected"
